<title>MALAYSIA: Metroplex to release news on Monday.</title>
<headline>Metroplex to release news on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metroplex Bhd will release a company announcement near the close of market trading on Monday, a company official said.</p>
<p>The official declined to provide any further details. Shares of the housing and property developer were suspended on Monday at the company's request. The company is also involved in hotel services and gaming.</p>
<p>Shares of Metroplex closed at 2.96 ringgit on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
